# PROJECT: AI-POWERED EMAIL THREAT DETECTION, FORENSIC INTELLIGENCE AND INFRASTRUCTURE-AWARE PHISHING ANALYSIS

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, cybersecurity architect, email-forensics specialist, machine-learning engineer and product designer.

Build a complete, functional, modular web application for phishing email detection, email header forensics, infrastructure intelligence, threat correlation and analyst investigation.

This is not a static UI prototype, dashboard mock-up, or simple LLM-powered email classifier.

Build an actual application with a functional backend, structured analysis engine, tested forensic processing, configurable integrations, evidence traceability and a professional analyst interface.

Prioritize:
1. Technical correctness.
2. Evidence integrity.
3. Security and privacy.
4. Modular architecture.
5. Reproducibility.
6. Explainability.
7. Professional user experience.
8. Extensibility.

